    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>What we photograph</h2>
      <a class="textlink" href="services.html">See services and prices</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="kinds">
      <li><h3>Portraits</h3><p>Individuals, couples, and families, at home or outdoors.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Weddings and events</h3><p>A full day of coverage, told in the order it happened.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Editorial and brand</h3><p>Pictures for magazines, makers, and small businesses.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Travel</h3><p>Coasts, cities, and quiet places, seen slowly.</p></li>
