<section class="section paper statement">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>We don&rsquo;t own a single strobe.</h2>
      <p>Window light, open shade, the last hour before sunset. Working with the light that&rsquo;s already in the room keeps people relaxed and pictures honest.</p>
      <p>The name comes from the sunprint, the oldest kind of photograph, made from paper, sunlight, and water. We still think that&rsquo;s enough.</p>
      <p><a class="textlink" href="about.html">Read the studio story</a></p>
    </div>
